Package: peacebuilder
Type: Package
Title: Build Peace Science Data Panels
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Ruslan", "Guseinov", email = "rigusseinov@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for building panel datasets for political scientists 
    and peace science researchers. The package includes functions for creating state panels 
    (with flexible opportunities to refine them) and adding socio-economic, political and 
    conflict-related indicators. 
